# .cursorrules — topagents.lol AI Agent Directory

# Core Philosophy
- Product: Product Hunt for AI Agents (Top 100 AI Agents directory).
- Content: Human-grade editorial, zero AI slop, >= 2,000 words per agent profile.
- UI: Product Hunt style design (signature upvote buttons, category tabs, featured spotlight, clean card grid).
- SEO: Fully programmatic Next.js 14 App Router, static generation, JSON-LD Schema.org.

# Invariants
- Zero AI Slop: Ban phrases like "in today's fast-paced digital world", "delve into", "game-changer", "testament to".
- Minimum 2,000 words per agent profile.
- All submissions are 100% free.
- Strict TypeScript with zero `any` types.

# Development
- Check `context/` directory for full specifications.
- Always run `npm run build` to verify changes before marking tasks complete.
